    {"kind": "body", "text": "Rated as an operations tool rather than a demo, the platform's defining quality is that it refuses to lie. Every push reports which transport actually carried it. Every change is preceded by a snapshot and followed by a result note that names what happened. Boundaries are printed where other products would quietly imply capability. That ethos, more than any individual feature, is what makes it safe to let the automation act on real hardware."},
